5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’ve seen programs stall when the underlying support wasn’t there. Let’s check the staffing and booking records first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to see what the earlier attempts actually produced. Let’s look at the readmission figures and the board minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to see where the pressure actually lands. I’ll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I need to know what this budget can actually build and what it earns back. I’ll check the development allocation and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about whether the place can absorb anything new. I’ll look into the rooms and parking, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’m glad we’re all looking at the practical side. I’ll check the data agreements and the shared nursing round to see where things might slip.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll also check the visit completion on the shared nursing round. It shows how fragile those arrangements can be.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I’ll also look at the booking system records. If work isn’t logged, it vanishes from reports, making staffing pressure invisible.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I’ll also check the board minutes. If a joint clinic collapsed over rota and budget, that’s a warning for any shared model.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I’ll also check the regional fund tariffs. If we can’t bill for home visits, the whole idea might not sustain itself financially.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
